---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Use — Kippi"
  description="Kippi terms of use. Kippi is a companion app, not a medical service."
  canonical="/terms"
>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a href="/" class="wordmark" aria-label="Kippi home">Kippi</a>
  </header>

  <main class="legal-main">
    <article class="legal-article">

      <!--
        FOUNDER REVIEW FLAG:
        This is template legal copy for a pre-launch site.
        Before go-live (and certainly before App Store submission), please:
        1. Have a lawyer review this document.
        2. Replace all [PLACEHOLDER] values below.
        3. Confirm jurisdiction and governing law (currently: [JURISDICTION]).
      -->

      <header class="legal-header">
        <p class="legal-label">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="legal-title font-display">Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="legal-date">Last updated: [DATE] &mdash; <strong>DRAFT — REQUIRES FOUNDER AND LEGAL REVIEW BEFORE GO-LIVE</strong></p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-body">

        <h2>1. About these terms</h2>
        <p>
          These terms of use apply to your use of the Kippi website at kippi.help,
          operated by [COMPANY NAME] ("[JURISDICTION]").
          By accessing this site, you agree to these terms.
        </p>
        <p>
          These terms do not yet cover the Kippi mobile application.
          Separate terms will be published before the app launches.
        </p>

        <h2>2. What this site is</h2>
        <p>
          This site provides information about the Kippi app (currently in development)
          and allows you to join a waitlist to be notified when it launches.
          The site is informational only.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Not medical advice</h2>
        <div class="legal-disclaimer">
          <p>
            <strong>Kippi is not a medical service.</strong> Nothing on this site,
            and nothing in the Kippi app, constitutes medical, psychological,
            or clinical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
          </p>
          <p>
            Kippi is a supportive companion application intended to provide
            in-the-moment emotional support. It is not a substitute for
            professional mental health treatment, therapy, or emergency services.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>If you're in crisis, struggling to stay safe, or thinking about harming yourself, please reach out for help now.</strong>
            In the US, call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a> (Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline), or call ANAD's eating-disorders helpline at <a href="tel:8883757767">888-375-7767</a>. Outside the US, please contact your local emergency services. Kippi cannot respond to emergencies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>By using this site, you agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Attempt to interfere with, disrupt, or overload the site or its infrastructure</li>
          <li>Submit false, misleading, or fraudulent information</li>
          <li>Use the site for any unlawful purpose</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the site or its backend systems</li>
          <li>Harvest or collect personal data of other users</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this site — including the Kippi name, wordmark, mascot character,
          design, and copy — is owned by [COMPANY NAME] and protected by applicable copyright
          and trademark law. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works
          from this content without our written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
        <p>
          This site is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind, express or implied.
          We do not warrant that the site will be available at all times, free of errors,
          or suitable for any particular purpose.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, [COMPANY NAME] will not be liable
          for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from
          your use of this site or the Kippi app.
          Our total liability to you for any claim arising from these terms or your use
          of the site will not exceed [AMOUNT, e.g., USD $100].
        </p>

        <h2>8. Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          This site may link to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the
          content, privacy practices, or accuracy of those sites.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of [JURISDICTION, e.g., the State of California, USA],
          without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
          Any disputes will be resolved in the courts of [JURISDICTION].
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time.
          When we do, we will update the "last updated" date above.
          Continued use of the site after any changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms? Email us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@kippi.help">hello@kippi.help</a>.
        </p>

      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer-legal">
    <p class="footer-crisis-legal">
      If you're in crisis, struggling to stay safe, or thinking about harming yourself, please reach out now.
      In the US, call or text <a href="tel:988" class="crisis-link-legal">988</a> (Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline),
      or call ANAD's eating-disorders helpline at <a href="tel:8883757767" class="crisis-link-legal">888-375-7767</a>.
      Outside the US, please contact your local emergency services.
      Kippi is a companion, not an emergency service, and not a substitute for professional help.
    </p>
    <div class="footer-legal-nav">
      <a href="/">Back to Kippi</a>
      <span>&middot;</span>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      <span>&copy; 2026 Kippi</span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  .site-header {
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--side-margin);
  }
  .wordmark {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-variation-settings: 'WONK' 0.6, 'opsz' 18;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-main {
    padding: var(--space-12) var(--side-margin) var(--space-20);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .legal-article {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .legal-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-date {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .legal-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: calc(-1 * var(--space-3));
  }

  .legal-body p,
  .legal-body li {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--accent-secondary);
  }

  .legal-disclaimer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    /* Moss left-accent thread — thin, purely decorative */
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(122, 158, 110, 0.45);
  }

  .legal-disclaimer p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .site-footer-legal {
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--side-margin);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .footer-crisis-legal {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .crisis-link-legal {
    color: var(--semantic-crisis);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .crisis-link-legal:hover { color: var(--semantic-crisis); }

  .footer-legal-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .site-footer-legal a {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .site-footer-legal a:hover { color: var(--text-secondary); }

  .site-footer-legal span {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .site-header { padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-10); }
    .legal-main { padding-left: var(--space-10); padding-right: var(--space-10); }
  }
</style>
